
1. Commands while disarmed
> DISARM
> VEL 0.02
< ACK DISARM
< ERR DISARMED

2. Valid commands keep the controller armed
> ARM
> VEL 0.02
< ACK ARM
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> VEL 0.02
< ACK VEL
> STATUS
< STATE ARMED NONZERO

3. Silence must trigger the watchdog
< EVENT TIMEOUT DISARMED
> STATUS
> VEL 0.02
< STATE DISARMED ZERO
< ERR DISARMED

4. Invalid commands must not feed the watchdog
> ARM
> VEL nan
< ACK ARM
< ERR VALUE
> VEL 1.0
< ERR RANGE
> VEL abc
< ERR VALUE
> HELLO
< ERR COMMAND
< EVENT TIMEOUT DISARMED
> STATUS
< STATE DISARMED ZERO

5. STOP clears velocity; DISARM clears arming
> ARM
> VEL -0.02
> STOP
> STATUS
> DISARM
> STATUS
< ACK ARM
< ACK VEL
< ACK STOP
< STATE ARMED ZERO
< ACK DISARM
< STATE DISARMED ZERO
> DISARM
< ACK DISARM
